       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115IPC0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Part_Charge.      00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220000
      *                                                                 00230000
      *    Initialize                          R115IPC0-Part-Charge     00240000
      *    Set   R115IPC0-Version        To    True                     00250000
      *    Set   R115IPC0-In-Select      To    True                     00260000
      *                                                                 00270000
      * One of these:                                                   00280008
      * 1) Set   R115IPC0-In-Actual      To    True                     00290008
      * 2) Set   R115IPC0-In-Work        To    True                     00300008
      *                                                                 00310008
      * One of these:                                                   00320000
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00330000
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00340000
      *                                                                 00350000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-Type00360000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-No  00370000
      *                                                                 00380000
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IPC0-In-CA-Currency  00390000
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No    00400000
      *                                                                 00410000
      *    Move  &role-type              To    R115IPC0-In-Role-Type    00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *    Move  &charge-type            To    R115IPC0-In-CT-Type      00440000
      *                                                                 00450000
      *    Call  'F115IPC0'              Using R115IPC0-Part-Charge     00460000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00470000
      *    End-Call                                                     00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00500000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00510000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00520000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00530000
      *                                                                 00540000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00550000
      *        ...not found...                                          00560000
      *                                                                 00570000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00580000
      *        ...found...                                              00590000
      *                                                                 00600000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00610000
      *                                                                 00620000
      *################################################################*00630000
