      *160999!HLR! Relation to TF_Main_Charge is moved to        !LG10! 00670013
      *      !   ! TF_Charge_type, and FK_TFCH_Seq_No is deleted.!    ! 00680013
      *060599!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00690013
