      *################################################################*02790000
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02800000
      *                                                                 02810000
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02820000
      *                                                                 02830000
           Evaluate True                                                02840000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02850000
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02860000
             When Other                                                 02870000
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02880000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02890000
      *                                                                 02900000
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    02910000
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             02920000
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               02930000
      *                                                                 02940000
           If  Sw-IA-Initialize                                         02950000
           or  WS-DB2-Row-Status (1)     Not   Numeric                  02960000
               Initialize                      W-Storage                02970000
               Move  +0                  To    Ind-WS-Put               02980000
           End-If                                                       02990000
      *                                                                 03000000
