      *################################################################.04050000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       04060000
      *                                                                 04070000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 04080000
      *                                                                 04090000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           04100000
      *                                                                 04110000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           04120000
