           Inspect WE-Contract-Type     Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04180014
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04190014
               Inspect WE-Contract-Type  Converting '* ' to '%%'        04200014
           End-If                                                       04210014
      *                                                                 04220000
           Evaluate R115IPC0-In-From-Contr-No                           04230000
           also     R115IPC0-In-To-Contr-No                             04240000
