                                                                        04380000
             When any                                                   04390000
             also +0                                                    04400000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-From-Contr-No                          04410000
                                         To    WE-From-Contr-No         04420000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-From-Contr-No                          04430000
                                         To    WE-To-Contr-No           04440000
                                                                        04450000
             When other                                                 04460000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-From-Contr-No                          04470000
                                         To    WE-From-Contr-No         04480000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-To-Contr-No                            04490000
                                         To    WE-To-Contr-No           04500000
                                                                        04510000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04520000
      *                                                                 04530000
