           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04550005
           Inspect WE-CA-Currency       Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04560005
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04570005
               Inspect WE-CA-Currency    Converting '* ' to '%%'        04580005
