                                                                        04650000
             When other                                                 04660000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No                              04670000
                                         To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04680000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No                              04690000
                                         To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04700000
                                                                        04710000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04720000
      *                                                                 04730000
