      *                                                                 04750000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-CT-Type     To    WE-CT-Type               04760005
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04770005
           Inspect WE-CT-Type           Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04780005
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04790005
               Inspect WE-CT-Type        Converting '* ' to '%%'        04800005
           End-If                                                       04810005
      *                                                                 04820005
           .                                                            04830000
      *################################################################.04840000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       04850000
      *                                                                 04860000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       04870000
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          04880000
      *                                                                 04890000
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           04900000
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   04910000
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         04920000
      *                                                                 04930000
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       04940000
      *                                                                 04950000
      * We check that we do not have any "negative" intervals.          04960000
      * DB2 is not very fond of those...                                04970000
      *                                                                 04980000
           If  WS-From-Contr-No          >     WS-To-Contr-No           04990000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05000000
               Move  'TFMC-NEG-QUAL-CONTR-NO'                           05010000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05020000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05030000
               Move  WS-From-Contr-No    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05040000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)05050000
               Move  WS-To-Contr-No      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)05060000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05070000
               Move  'D201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05080000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05090000
           End-If                                                       05100000
      *                                                                 05110000
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              05120000
      *                                                                 05130000
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 05140000
      *                                                                 05150000
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         05160000
           Move  WE-Contract-Type        To    W-DB-Contract-Type       05170000
      *                                                                 05180000
           Move  WE-From-Contr-No        To    W-DB-From-Contr-No       05190000
           Move  WE-To-Contr-No          To    W-DB-To-Contr-No         05200000
      *                                                                 05210000
           Move  WE-CA-Currency          To    W-DB-CA-Currency         05220000
           Move  WE-From-PA-Seq-No       To    W-DB-From-PA-Seq-No      05230000
           Move  WE-To-PA-Seq-No         To    W-DB-To-PA-Seq-No        05240000
      *                                                                 05250000
           Move  WE-Role-Type            To    W-DB-Role-Type           05260000
      *                                                                 05270000
           Move  WE-CT-Type              To    W-DB-CT-Type             05280000
      *                                                                 05290000
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    05300000
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          =     +0                       05310000
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            05320000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           05330000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         05340000
           End-If                                                       05350000
      *                                                                 05360000
           .                                                            05370000
      *################################################################.05380000
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       05390000
      *                                                                 05400000
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  05410000
      *                                                                 05420000
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           05430000
      *                                                                 05440000
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          Not = +0                       05450000
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     05460000
           End-If                                                       05470000
      *                                                                 05480000
           If  R115IPC0-In-Contract-Type =     Space                    05490000
           and R115IPC0-In-Contract-No   =     +0                       05500000
             Then                                                       05510000
               Continue                                                 05520000
             Else                                                       05530000
               Set   SW-Use-Contract     To    True                     05540000
           End-If                                                       05550000
      *                                                                 05560000
           If  R115IPC0-In-CA-Currency   =     Space                    05570000
           and R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No     =     +0                       05580000
             Then                                                       05590000
               Continue                                                 05600000
             Else                                                       05610000
               Set  Sw-Use-Part-Amount   To    True                     05620000
           End-If                                                       05630000
      *                                                                 05640000
           If  W-DB-Role-Type            Not = Space                    05650000
           and W-DB-Role-Type (1:1)      Not = '%'                      05660000
               Set  Sw-Use-Role          To    True                     05670000
           End-If                                                       05680000
      *                                                                 05690000
           If  R115IPC0-In-CT-Type       Not = Space                    05700013
               Set   SW-Use-Charge       To    True                     05710003
           End-If                                                       05720000
      *                                                                 05730000
           Evaluate True                                                05740000
             When SW-Use-Fi-Asc                                         05750000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-Asc                                      05760001
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Ro-Asc                                      05770001
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                                      05780013
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-PA-Asc                                   05790001
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-Ro-Asc                                   05800001
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-CT-Asc                                   05810013
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-Pa-Ro-Asc                                05820001
             or   SW-Use-Fi-Co-Pa-CT-Asc                                05830013
             or   SW-Use-Everything-Asc                                 05840001
               Continue                                                 05850000
      *                                                                 05860000
             When other                                                 05870000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05880000
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05890000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05900000
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05910000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05920000
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05930000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05940000
      *                                                                 05950000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05960000
      *                                                                 05970000
           .                                                            05980000
      *################################################################.05990000
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       06000000
      *                                                                 06010000
           Initialize                          R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  06020000
           Set   R115IPCS-Version        To    True                     06030000
           Set   R115IPCS-In-Count-Cursor                               06040000
                                         To    True                     06050000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              06060009
                                         To    R115IPCS-In-Table-Version06070009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPCS-Cursor-Code     06080000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPCS-DB-Key          06090000
      *                                                                 06100000
           Call  'F115IPCR'              Using R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  06110000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Charge        06120002
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06130000
           End-Call                                                     06140000
      *                                                                 06150000
           Evaluate True                                                06160000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06170000
               Move  R115IPCS-Out-Total-Rows                            06180000
                                         To    WC-Total-No-Of-Rows      06190000
      *                                                                 06200000
             When other                                                 06210000
               Move  'D401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06220000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06230000
      *                                                                 06240000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06250000
      *                                                                 06260000
           .                                                            06270000
      *################################################################.06280000
       D500-Open-Cursor                  Section.                       06290000
      *                                                                 06300000
           Initialize                          R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  06310000
           Set   R115IPCS-Version        To    True                     06320000
           Set   R115IPCS-In-Open-Cursor To    True                     06330000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              06340009
                                         To    R115IPCS-In-Table-Version06350009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPCS-Cursor-Code     06360000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPCS-DB-Key          06370000
      *                                                                 06380000
           Call  'F115IPCR'              Using R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  06390000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Charge        06400002
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06410000
           End-Call                                                     06420000
      *                                                                 06430000
           Evaluate True                                                06440000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    06450000
               Set   WS-Cursor-OK        To    True                     06460000
      *                                                                 06470000
             When other                                                 06480000
               Move  'D501'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06490000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06500000
      *                                                                 06510000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06520000
      *                                                                 06530000
           .                                                            06540000
      *################################################################.06550000
       E000-Get-Next                     Section.                       06560000
      *                                                                 06570000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   06580000
           Perform E100-Check-Qualification                             06590000
           Perform E200-Fetch-Cursor                                    06600000
      *                                                                 06610000
           If  R7919999-Return-OK                                       06620000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06630000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06640000
           End-If                                                       06650000
      *                                                                 06660000
           .                                                            06670000
      *################################################################.06680000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       06690000
      *                                                                 06700000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         06710000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     06720000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    06730000
      *                                                                 06740000
           Evaluate True                                                06750000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06760000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06770000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          06780000
               Continue                                                 06790000
      *                                                                 06800000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06810000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06820000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         06830000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06840000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06850000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06860000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06870000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06880000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06890000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06900000
      *                                                                 06910000
             When Other                                                 06920000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06930000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06940000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06950000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06960000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06970000
      *                                                                 06980000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06990000
      *                                                                 07000000
           .                                                            07010000
      *################################################################.07020000
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       07030000
      *                                                                 07040000
           Initialize                          R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  07050000
           Set   R115IPCS-Version        To    True                     07060000
           Set   R115IPCS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               07070000
                                         To    True                     07080000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              07090009
                                         To    R115IPCS-In-Table-Version07100009
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115IPCS-Cursor-Code     07110000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115IPCS-DB-Key          07120000
      *                                                                 07130000
           Call  'F115IPCR'              Using R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  07140000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Charge        07150002
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07160000
           End-Call                                                     07170000
      *                                                                 07180000
           Evaluate True                                                07190000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07200000
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                07210000
      *                                                                 07220000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07230000
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     07240000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       07250000
                 Then                                                   07260000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    07270000
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              07280000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07290000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07300000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07310000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           07320000
                 Else                                                   07330000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    07340000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07350000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07360000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07370000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           07380000
               End-If                                                   07390000
      *                                                                 07400000
             When other                                                 07410000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07420000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07430000
      *                                                                 07440000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07450000
      *                                                                 07460000
           .                                                            07470000
      *################################################################.07480000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       07490000
      *                                                                 07500000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           07510000
      *                                                                 07520000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       07530000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               07540000
      *                                                                 07550000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        07560000
      *                                                                 07570000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     07580000
      *                                                                 07590000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         07600000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 07610000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  07620000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   07630000
           End-If                                                       07640000
      *                                                                 07650000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       07660000
      *                                                                 07670000
           Evaluate True                                                07680000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  07690000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Part-Charge        07700002
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 07710000
      *                                                                 07720000
             When other                                                 07730000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07740000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07750000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07760000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07770000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)07780000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              07790000
               Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No    To WD-Contract-No              07800000
               Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No      To WD-PA-Seq-No                07810000
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        07820000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07830000
                      FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       Delimited by space       07840000
                      WD-Contract-No           Delimited by size        07850000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07860000
                      FK-TFCA-Currency         Delimited by space       07870000
                      WD-PA-Seq-No             Delimited by size        07880000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07890000
                      FK-KFTY-Role-Type        Delimited by space       07900000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07910001
                      FK-TFCT-Type             Delimited by space       07920001
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)07930000
               End-String                                               07940000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07950000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07960000
                                         To    True                     07970000
      *                                                                 07980000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07990000
      *                                                                 08000000
           .                                                            08010000
      *################################################################.08020000
       F100-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       08030000
      *                                                                 08040000
      * We fill in the host variables for the SQL.                      08050000
      *                                                                 08060000
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Part-Charge        08070002
      *                                                                 08080000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       08090000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Contract-Type                              08100000
                                         To    FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       08110000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Contract-No To    FK-TFMC-Contr-No         08120000
      *                                                                 08130000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-CA-Currency To    FK-TFCA-Currency         08140001
           Move  R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No   To    FK-TFPA-Seq-No           08150001
      *                                                                 08160000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Role-Type   To    FK-KFTY-Role-Type        08170000
      *                                                                 08180000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-CT-Type     To    FK-TFCT-Type             08190001
      *                                                                 08200001
           If  R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    08210000
           and R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID   =     +0                       08220000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            08230000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08240000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08250000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       08260000
           End-If                                                       08270000
      *                                                                 08280000
           .                                                            08290000
      *################################################################.08300000
       F200-Select-Row                   Section.                       08310000
      *                                                                 08320000
           Initialize                          R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  08330000
           Set   R115IPCS-Version        To    True                     08340000
           Set   R115IPCS-In-Select      To    True                     08350000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              08360009
                                         To    R115IPCS-In-Table-Version08370009
      *                                                                 08380000
           Call  'F115IPCR'              Using R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  08390000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Charge        08400002
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      08410000
           End-Call                                                     08420000
      *                                                                 08430000
           Evaluate True                                                08440000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    08450000
               Continue                                                 08460000
      *                                                                 08470000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 08480000
               Continue                                                 08490000
      *                                                                 08500000
             When other                                                 08510000
               Move  'F201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       08520000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       08530000
      *                                                                 08540000
           End-Evaluate                                                 08550000
      *                                                                 08560000
           .                                                            08570000
      *################################################################.08580000
       G000-Insert                       Section.                       08590000
      *                                                                 08600000
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               08610000
           Perform G200-Insert-Row                                      08620000
      *                                                                 08630000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      08640000
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       08650000
      *                                                                 08660000
           .                                                            08670000
      *################################################################.08680000
       G100-Move-Input-To-DCL            Section.                       08690000
      *                                                                 08700000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                08710006
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     08720006
      *    the same modifications in module F115APC0 - E200-section.    08730006
      *                                                                 08740006
           Initialize                          DCLTF-Part-Charge        08750002
      *                                                                 08760000
           Move R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID     To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       08770000
           If  R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-No      Not = Space                    08780000
           and R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID      =     +0                       08790000
               Move  R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-No                               08800000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08810000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08820000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       08830000
           End-If                                                       08840000
      *                                                                 08850000
           Move R115IPC0-Contract-Type   To    FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       08860000
           Move R115IPC0-Contract-No     To    FK-TFMC-Contr-No         08870000
      *                                                                 08880000
           Move R115IPC0-CA-Currency     To    FK-TFCA-Currency         08890000
           Move R115IPC0-PA-Seq-No       To    FK-TFPA-Seq-No           08900000
      *                                                                 08910000
           Move R115IPC0-Role-Type       To    FK-KFTY-Role-Type        08920000
      *                                                                 08930000
           Move R115IPC0-CT-Type         To    FK-TFCT-Type             08940001
      *                                                                 08950001
           Move R115IPC0-Currency        To    TFPC-Currency            08960001
           Move R115IPC0-Amount          To    TFPC-Charge-Amount       08970001
           Move R115IPC0-Role-Paying-Pty To    FK-KFTY-Paying-Pty       08980001
           Move R115IPC0-Charge-Pct      To    TFPC-Charge-Pct          08990012
           Move R115IPC0-Charge-Text     To    TFPC-Charge-Text-Text    08991017
           Move R115IPC0-Text-Len        To    TFPC-Charge-Text-Len     08992017
      *                                                                 09000000
           .                                                            09010000
      *################################################################.09020000
       G200-Insert-Row                   Section.                       09030000
      *                                                                 09040000
           Initialize                          R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  09050000
           Set   R115IPCS-Version        To    True                     09060000
           Set   R115IPCS-In-Insert      To    True                     09070000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              09080009
                                         To    R115IPCS-In-Table-Version09090009
      *                                                                 09100000
           Call  'F115IPCU'              Using R115IPCS-SQL-Submodules  09110000
                                               DCLTF-Part-Charge        09120002
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      09130000
           End-Call                                                     09140000
      *                                                                 09150000
           Evaluate True                                                09160000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    09170000
               Continue                                                 09180000
      *                                                                 09190000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 09200000
               Continue                                                 09210000
      *                                                                 09220000
             When other                                                 09230000
               Move  'G201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       09240000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       09250000
      *                                                                 09260000
           End-Evaluate                                                 09270000
      *                                                                 09280000
           .                                                            09290000
      *################################################################.09300000
       H000-Update                       Section.                       09310000
      *                                                                 09320000
           Perform H100-Check-Qualification                             09330000
           Perform G100-Move-Input-To-DCL                               09340000
      *                                                                 09350000
           Perform H200-Update-Row                                      09360000
      *                                                                 09370000
           Perform L300-Remove-DCL                                      09380000
           Perform L100-Store-DCL                                       09390000
      *                                                                 09400000
           .                                                            09410000
      *################################################################.09420000
       H100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       09430000
      *                                                                 09440000
           Evaluate True                                                09450000
             When R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID   Not = +0                       09460000
               Continue                                                 09470000
                                                                        09480000
             When R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-No   Not = Space                    09490000
               Move  R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-No                               09500000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09510000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           09520000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID     09530000
                                                                        09540000
             When R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-Id Not = +0                      09550000
               Move R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID                             09560000
                                         To    R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID     09570000
                                                                        09580000
             When R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No                               09590000
                                         Not = Space                    09600000
               Move  R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            09610000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            09620000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           09630000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID     09640000
                                                                        09650000
             When other                                                 09660000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    09670000
               Move  'TF-FIN-INST-MISSING'                              09680000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  09690000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               09700000
