      *                                                                 11620006
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    R115IPC0-Fin-Inst-ID     11630000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    R115IPC0-Contract-Type   11640000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    R115IPC0-Contract-No     11650000
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    R115IPC0-CA-Currency     11660000
