           .                                                            11860000
      *################################################################.11870000
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       11880000
      *                                                                 11890000
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      11900000
      *                                                                 11910000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        11920000
      *                                                                 11930000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11940000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 11950000
             Then                                                       11960000
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         11970000
      *        we start on the beginning.                               11980000
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       11990000
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               12000000
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12010000
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               12020000
               End-If                                                   12030000
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   12040000
             Else                                                       12050000
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               12060000
           End-If                                                       12070000
      *                                                                 12080000
      * We store the identification.                                    12090000
      *                                                                 12100000
           Move  R115IPC0-In-Table-Version                              12110009
                                         To    WS-DB2-Tbl-Version       12120009
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12130009
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       12140000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12150000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    WS-DB2-Contract-Type     12160000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12170000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    WS-DB2-Contract-No       12180000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12190000
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    WS-DB2-CA-Currency       12200000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12210000
           Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No          To    WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No         12220000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12230000
           Move  FK-KFTY-Role-Type       To    WS-DB2-Role-Type         12240000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12250000
           Move  FK-TFCT-Type            To    WS-DB2-CT-Type           12260001
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12270001
      *                                                                 12280000
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  12290000
      *                                                                 12300000
           Evaluate True                                                12310000
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Part-Charge        12320002
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               12330000
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Part-Charge        12340002
                                         To    WD-Length                12350000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    12360000
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  12370000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)12380000
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)12390000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               12400000
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       12410000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       12420000
      *                                                                 12430000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 12440000
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      12450000
                                         To    True                     12460000
      *                                                                 12470000
             When other                                                 12480000
               Move  DCLTF-Part-Charge   To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)12490002
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           12500000
                                         To    True                     12510000
      *                                                                 12520000
           End-Evaluate                                                 12530000
      *                                                                 12540000
           .                                                            12550000
      *################################################################.12560000
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       12570000
      *                                                                 12580000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       12590000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       12600000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12610000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    12620009
                                         =     R115IPC0-In-Table-Version12630009
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    12640009
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       12650000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  12660000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       12670000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    12680000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         12690000
                     and WS-DB2-CA-Currency (Ind-WS)                    12700000
                                         =     FK-TFCA-Currency         12710000
                     and WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No (Ind-WS)                      12720000
                                         =     FK-TFPA-Seq-No           12730000
                     and WS-DB2-Role-Type (Ind-WS)                      12740000
                                         =     FK-KFTY-Role-Type        12750001
                     and WS-DB2-CT-Type (Ind-WS)                        12760001
                                         =     FK-TFCT-Type )           12770013
           End-Perform                                                  12780000
      *                                                                 12790000
           .                                                            12800000
      *################################################################*12810000
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       12820000
