      *################################################################*13660000
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       13670000
      *                                                                 13680000
      * Version control.                                                13690000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         13700000
      *                                                                 13710000
           Set   R115IPC0-Version        To    True                     13720000
           Move  Length                  Of    R115IPC0-Part-Charge     13730002
                                         To    W-IO-Length              13740000
      *                                                                 13750000
           Evaluate True                                                13760000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115IPC0-Version-No      13770000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            13780000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              13790000
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      13800000
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            13810000
      *                                                                 13820000
             When Other                                                 13830000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         13840000
                   Using By Content      'F115IPC0 '                    13850000
                                         'INPUT '                       13860000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  13870000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  13880000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            13890000
               End-Call                                                 13900000
      *                                                                 13910000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                13920000
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       13930000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   13940000
               End-If                                                   13950000
      *                                                                 13960000
           End-Evaluate                                                 13970000
      *                                                                 13980000
