      *                                                                 14050000
           Evaluate True                                                14060000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115IPC0-Version-No      14070000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14080000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              14090000
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            14100000
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)14110000
      *                                                                 14120000
             When Other                                                 14130000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         14140000
                   Using By Content      'F115IPC0 '                    14150000
                                         'OUTPUT '                      14160000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  14170000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  14180000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            14190000
               End-Call                                                 14200000
      *                                                                 14210000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                14220000
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14230000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14240000
               End-If                                                   14250000
      *                                                                 14260000
