           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     14330000
      *                                                                 14340000
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    14350000
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  14360000
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             14370000
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     14380000
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        14390000
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     14400000
           End-If                                                       14410000
      *                                                                 14420000
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    14430000
           End-Call                                                     14440000
      *                                                                 14450000
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               14460000
                                         To    R7919999-Message         14470000
      *                                                                 14480000
           .                                                            14490000
      *################################################################*14500000
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       14510000
      *                                                                 14520000
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  14530000
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                14540000
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      14550000
           End-If                                                       14560000
      *                                                                 14570000
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      14580000
      *                                                                 14590000
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          14600000
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      14610000
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )14620000
               Move  'F115IPC0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     14630000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)14640000
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     14650000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)14660000
           End-If                                                       14670000
      *                                                                 14680000
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     14690000
      *                                                                 14700000
           Goback.                                                      14710000
